# Migration assessment: `OVHcloud`, `Scaleway`, `UpCloud`

- Inventory file: `inventory.json`
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `OVHcloud` snapshot from `https://www.ovhcloud.com/en-ie/public-cloud/prices/`, retrieved 2026-11-14
- Catalog: `Scaleway` snapshot from `https://www.scaleway.com/en/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-13
- Catalog: `UpCloud` snapshot from `https://upcloud.com/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-13

## Comparison

### Summary

| Fit | `OVHcloud` | `Scaleway` | `UpCloud` |
|---|---|---|---|
| direct | 6 | 5 | 5 |
| partial | 2 | 5 | 3 |
| none | 3 | 1 | 3 |
| total | 11 | 11 | 11 |

### Resources

| ID | Category | `OVHcloud` fit | `OVHcloud` best offering | `Scaleway` fit | `Scaleway` best offering | `UpCloud` fit | `UpCloud` best offering |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` | direct | `Object Storage` | direct | `Managed Object Storage` |
| `cluster-example` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` | direct | `Kubernetes Kapsule Dedicated` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Production` |
| `db-autoscaling-example` | `database.postgresql` | partial | `Managed PostgreSQL` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL` | partial | `Managed PostgreSQL` |
| `db-example` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` |
| `db-node-example` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` | direct | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` |
| `db-zone-example` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL` | partial | `Managed PostgreSQL` |
| `fn-example` | `serverless.function` | none |  | direct | `Serverless Functions` | none |  |
| `fn-ipv6-example` | `serverless.function` | none |  | partial | `Serverless Functions` | none |  |
| `i-0123456789abcdef0` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | direct | `Instances` | direct | `Cloud Servers` |
| `misc-example` | `unclassified` | none |  | none |  | none |  |
| `partial-example` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` | partial | `Instances` | partial | `Cloud Servers` |

### Blockers on every target

- `misc-example`
  - `OVHcloud`: not classified
  - `Scaleway`: not classified
  - `UpCloud`: not classified

## `OVHcloud`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 6 |
| partial | 2 |
| none | 3 |
| total | 11 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` (tie: `Object Storage 3-AZ`) | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `cluster-example` | `AWS::EKS::Cluster` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-autoscaling-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBCluster` | `database.postgresql` | partial | `Managed PostgreSQL` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) | `Managed PostgreSQL` does not offer `autoscaling` |
| `db-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-node-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-zone-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `fn-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `fn-ipv6-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `i-0123456789abcdef0` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `misc-example` | `AWS::CloudFormation::CustomResource` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |
| `partial-example` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` | `Instances` does not offer `node-high-availability` |

### Required changes

- `db-autoscaling-example`: `autoscaling` (not offered by `Managed PostgreSQL`)
- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

### Blockers

- `fn-example`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `fn-ipv6-example`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`: not classified

